OL,3,AOil spill closes 18 beaches across Kent
OL,4,
OL,5,FEighteen beaches in Kent have been
OL,6,Fclosed after "significant deposits of
OL,7,Foil" were found along the coastline.
OL,9,FPopular tourist beaches at Margate and
OL,10,FRamsgate are among the areas affected
OL,11,Fby the spill.
OL,13,FThanet District Council (TDC) reported
OL,14,Fthe incident on Wednesday evening. The
OL,15,Fsource of the oil has not been
OL,16,Fidentified.
OL,18,FThe local authority said the decision
OL,19,Fto close access to beaches "had not
OL,20,Fbeen taken lightly".
